id=cacerts_der2pem
name=CA DER to PEM (validated companion)
version=v2.0.0
versionCode=2
author=zfj201
description=Validates existing CA files with Android X.509, then atomically normalizes DER files in writable tmpfs directory mounts. For compatible AlwaysTrustUserCerts setups; does not add CAs. Includes process-namespace verification. Android 8+; tested in isolated Android 15 fixtures.
